Warning [L0104] (unused_private_fn): Private function `answer` is never called or used as a value.
  --> tests/ui/ffi_inline_c_mismatch.jet:1:53
    |
  1 | #[Unsafe("deliberate mismatch fixture"), FFI(c)] fn answer() Int -> {
    |                                                     ^^^^^^
 Why: A private function with no reachable reference is dead code; public functions stay exempt because other modules may use them.
 Fix: Remove the function, or rename `answer` to `_answer` when it is intentional.
